WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
A Tahoe rider starts in the Fantic e-bike catalog.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The lineup groups bikes by terrain and shows prices
so the rider can compare models.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.500
The XTF 1.5 page brings one model into focus.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.500
The rider can check where the bike fits
and what to ask the shop.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Ready for a test ride? Choose
Olympic Valley or South Lake Tahoe.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
A prepared email connects the rider with the chosen shop.
The shop confirms availability directly.
